# AI Agent Skills and Docs (Local agent context, excluded from Git commits)
.agents/
**/.agents/
.kilo/
**/.kilo/
docs/
**/docs/

# Canonical shared contracts are tracked in Git.
# Git does not descend into an excluded directory, so the root docs directory
# must be unignored before the files inside it. The leading slash anchors the
# rule to the repository root: without it, "docs/" also matches every nested
# docs/ directory (backend/docs, simulator/docs, frontend/docs) and would
# unignore those local copies as well.
# Only the four canonical contract documents are re-included: every other file
# in docs/ and every nested docs/ directory stays ignored.
!/docs/
docs/*
!docs/api-contract.md
!docs/data-model.md
!docs/architecture.md
!docs/agent-ownership.md
